sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Artisan
  participant AA as Artisan app
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  participant AD as Admin dashboard
  actor M as Administrator
  participant CF as Cloud Functions
  A->>AA: Add an ID photo, a personal photo and certificates
  AA->>FS: verificationRequests/uid status pending, files as compressed images
  M->>AD: Open the verification queue
  AD->>FS: Read pending requests and their files
  alt approve
    M->>AD: Approve
    AD->>FS: status approved, users.verified true, artisanProfiles.verificationStatus approved
  else reject
    M->>AD: Reject with a reason
    AD->>FS: status rejected with rejectReason
  end
  FS-)CF: onVerificationUpdated
  CF->>FS: verificationApproved or verificationRejected notification, push sent
  Note over FS,CF: Only verified artisans are included in dispatch
